  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Restful Ridge: Your Tranquil Florida Getaway <br><br>**GOLF CART IS AVAILABLE FOR RENT FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE AT $100 PER DAY.**<br><br>Rare Amenities: R.V. or Boat Parking: two off-street driveways each with parking for 3+ vehicles Pet-Friendly: Fully fenced yard for up to 2 pups (pet fee required). <br><br>Relax in Old Florida Charm: Nestled on a quiet dead-end street, Restful Ridge offers a peaceful retreat just blocks from the Gulf of Mexico. Perfect for those who value tranquility and comfort. <br><br>Home Highlights: Beautifully landscaped 1/3 acre lot with tall evergreen shade trees and landscape lighting<br><br>Inviting Porches: Front porch with swing, couches, and chairs. Screened side porch with dining space for 8+<br><br>Screened back porch with serene fountain views. <br><br>Cozy Interiors: Open floor plan with upscale and comfortable furnishings. Gas fireplaces in the living room and master suite. Fully equipped chef’s kitchen with oversized island and ample seating. Spacious Bedrooms: Master suite with king bed, clawfoot tub, and private porch. Queen bedroom with private entrance. Bunk + queen room for the kiddos. Brand new 3rd full bath with ceramic tile shower and glass door; this bathroom has an extra entrance from the exterior of house for convenience of beach-goers.<br><br>Outdoor Oasis: Covered outdoor kitchen with sink, refrigerator, stone fireplace, and propane grill sink 2,220 square feet of decking with loungers, seating, string lights and a covered veranda. Enclosed outdoor shower <br><br>Prime Location: Less than one mile to the Gulf Place Town Center and the Ed Walline public beach access (featuring parking, restrooms, showers, and picnic tables); Close toHighway 30-A, Longleaf Pine Trailhead, Top Sail Hill Preserve State Park, Shunk Gulley Oyster Bar, the Perfect Pig, Stinky’s Fish Camp music venue, and more local favorites. <br><br>Booking Details: 50% deposit required at booking; balance due 30 days before arrival. Must be 25+ to rent; family-friendly policy enforced. Book now for the perfect blend of relaxation and adventure!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
